<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-BARCELONA FINAL WASHED OUT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BARCELONA FINAL WASHED OUT.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain washed out the final of the Barcelona Open men's tournament between Alberto Costa and fellow Spaniard Albert Portas on Sunday.</p>
<p>It has been rescheduled for Monday at 1300 GMT.</p>
</text>
